# Hisense A9 mainline gpio-keys (matched by input device name).
# Stock uses its private AI key for scan 766. BUTTON_16 is the standard A16
# mapping confirmed on run 10: a9service matches the unchanged scanCode 766
# for single/double/long-press assignments. UNKNOWN does not reach its handler.
# DT wakeup-source resumes Linux; WAKE also asks Android's input policy to
# leave noninteractive/doze state. A waking press may be consumed by policy.
# A device-specific layout replaces Generic.kl: keep the volume/power keys.
key 115   VOLUME_UP
key 114   VOLUME_DOWN
key 116   POWER
key 766   BUTTON_16   WAKE
